  "confirmationNote": "No history rewrite of any kind and no --no-verify commits: the whole point of the story is that the guards hold at commit time. Commit messages must not carry an attribution trailer; the hooks under test will refuse them once CHK-003 lands, and .githooks/commit-msg strips them before that. Tracked host hook files in .codex/ are regenerated through init-assets, never hand-edited.",
